    {
      "id": "section:5/block:26/seg:0",
      "source": "ARM / cppc_cpufreq",
      "source_hash": 1949788306272704161,
      "context_hash": 8268078880159247279,
      "translation": "ARM / cppc_cpufreq",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:34.200903Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:27/seg:0",
      "source": "ARM servers use ACPI CPPC (Collaborative Processor Performance Control) for firmware-assisted frequency scaling.",
      "source_hash": 2829697803355983860,
      "context_hash": 1039223532438631445,
      "translation": "ARM 서버는 펌웨어 지원 주파수 스케일링을 위해 ACPI CPPC(Collaborative Processor Performance Control)를 사용합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "ACPI": "ACPI",
        "firmware": "펌웨어"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:34.200903Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:27/seg:1",
      "source": "Similar to HWP: the OS writes desired performance, firmware adjusts clocks.",
      "source_hash": 5055965379803603665,
      "context_hash": 1636678022808384226,
      "translation": "HWP와 비슷하게, OS가 원하는 성능 값을 기록하면 펌웨어가 클록을 조정합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "firmware": "펌웨어"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:34.200904Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Frequency QoS (Quality of Service)",
      "source_hash": 799983824079420574,
      "context_hash": 12467317321687149233,
      "translation": "주파수 QoS(Quality of Service)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:34.200904Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Devices and drivers can impose constraints on CPU frequency via the frequency QoS API:",
      "source_hash": 412243325759719399,
      "context_hash": 2431976343634196267,
      "translation": "디바이스와 드라이버는 주파수 QoS API를 통해 CPU 주파수에 제약을 걸 수 있습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "API": "API",
        "CPU": "CPU",
        "devices": "디바이스",
        "drivers": "드라이버"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:34.200904Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Constraints from multiple requestors are combined (highest min / lowest max wins).",
      "source_hash": 15047332385250015903,
      "context_hash": 17029835813693825860,
      "translation": "여러 요청자의 제약은 하나로 결합됩니다(가장 높은 min / 가장 낮은 max가 적용됩니다).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:34.200904Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "C-states: idle power",
      "source_hash": 3684583728631561990,
      "context_hash": 13389489514337636836,
      "translation": "C-state: 유휴 전력",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:34.200905Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Separate from P-states, C-states are CPU idle states (when there's no work):",
      "source_hash": 17577339112307515638,
      "context_hash": 949535908465045051,
      "translation": "P-state와 별개로, C-state는 CPU 유휴 상태(처리할 작업이 없을 때)입니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:34.200905Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
