    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:30/seg:0",
      "source": "(Figures are representative `intel_idle` values for a Skylake-class core, from `skl_cstates[]` in `drivers/idle/intel_idle.c`; exact numbers vary by CPU generation.)",
      "source_hash": 15069231254421178148,
      "context_hash": 9295744354678315625,
      "translation": "(수치는 `drivers/idle/intel_idle.c`의 `skl_cstates[]`에서 가져온 Skylake 계열 코어의 대표적인 `intel_idle` 값이며, 정확한 수치는 CPU 세대에 따라 다릅니다.)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "CPU": "CPU"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:40.653435Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:31/seg:0",
      "source": "Note that C10 here is a per-core ACPI C-state, distinct from **Modern Standby** (also called S0ix / Low Power Idle), which is a *platform-wide* low-power mode entered instead of S3 suspend when every core, and the chipset, agree conditions are met.",
      "source_hash": 1866796332909378754,
      "context_hash": 16265951598607378082,
      "translation": "여기서 C10은 코어별 ACPI C-state이며, **Modern Standby**(S0ix / Low Power Idle이라고도 함)와는 다릅니다. Modern Standby는 모든 코어와 칩셋이 조건 충족에 동의할 때 S3 suspend 대신 진입하는 *플랫폼 전체* 저전력 모드입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "ACPI": "ACPI"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:40.653436Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:31/seg:1",
      "source": "Modern Standby is not part of the per-core C-state ladder and has its own, much coarser-grained latency budget — don't conflate the two.",
      "source_hash": 5984935239337810987,
      "context_hash": 2461159522384668570,
      "translation": "Modern Standby는 코어별 C-state 단계에 속하지 않으며 훨씬 더 거친 단위의 자체 지연 시간 예산을 가지므로, 두 가지를 혼동하지 마십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "latency": "지연 시간"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:40.653436Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:32/seg:0",
      "source": "The cpuidle subsystem selects C-states.",
      "source_hash": 13266379037094690532,
      "context_hash": 1399944474575008781,
      "translation": "cpuidle 서브시스템이 C-state를 선택합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "subsystem": "서브시스템"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:40.653436Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:32/seg:1",
      "source": "The governor (`menu` or `teo`) predicts next wakeup time and picks the deepest C-state with acceptable latency.",
      "source_hash": 7724783058963224949,
      "context_hash": 4034097979898778269,
      "translation": "governor(`menu` 또는 `teo`)는 다음 wakeup 시점을 예측하고, 허용 가능한 지연 시간을 갖는 가장 깊은 C-state를 선택합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "governor": "governor",
        "latency": "지연 시간"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:05:40.653436Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
